          en: 'The declared predicate alias dispatch 設定 equals dispatch configuration. NFKC maps full-width Ａ to A in scalar text. If delivered text is “A”, quote “Ａ” fails. If only “capacity fell” survived truncation, the omitted causal conclusion cannot be cited. A delivered sameAsBody may address that same body, never an absent receipt.',
